    doc = "Astrolab CLV-1 crewed Lunar Terrain Vehicle (NASA LTV demonstration task order, May 2026; derived from FLEX): about 4.0 x 2.3 x 2.6 m deployed (wheelbase 3.05 m, track 2.05 m) and up to 950 kg, two seated crew side by side with a central console in an open tub under a white tube roll cage with a roof light bar, a front fascia with a triangle grille and LED headlamps, a tall chamfered rear avionics box carrying the high-gain antenna, an open rear cargo rack, and four 0.93 m Venturi cable-spoke wheels with white side rings on active wheel-on-limb legs with tall steer posts and all-wheel steering."
